  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU own contribution Diakonia Honduras Employment 2015-2019</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EU-egeninsats Diakonia Honduras Syssels&#xe4;ttning 2015-2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Diakonia har f&#xe5;tt st&#xf6;d av EU f&#xf6;r en insats kring syssels&#xe4;ttning i Honduras under 2015-2019. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad konkurrenskraft och anst&#xe4;ndig syssels&#xe4;ttning f&#xf6;r kvinnor och ungdomar p&#xe5; landsbygden genom offentlig-privata samarbeten och st&#xf6;d av h&#xe5;llbara och innovativa socioekonomiska initiativ i sex kommuner. Detta bidrag t&#xe4;cker Diakonias egeninsats (25% av totalen f&#xf6;r projektet).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diakonia has received support from the EU for employment in Honduras during 2015-2019. The objective is improved competitiveness and decent employment opportunities for women and rural youth through public-private alliances and the backing of sustainable and innovative               socio-economic initiatives in six municipalities. This contribution covers Diakonias own contribution (25% of the total of the project).</narrative>
  </description>
